  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">peanut butter marshmallow cups are a sweet, no-bake treat that layers creamy peanut butter, pillowy marshmallow, and silky chocolate into one irresistible bite. With a snappy chocolate shell and a soft, gooey center, each cup hits that nutty-sweet, indulgent balance. Made with just a few pantry staples and ready in no time, they’re perfect for lunchboxes, after-school snacks, or cozy evenings when a little something special calls your name. Fun, nostalgic, and always a hit with kids and adults alike, peanut butter marshmallow cups turn everyday ingredients into delightful homemade candy.<br></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\">Why You’ll Love This PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients-for-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\">Ingredients for PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\">How to Make PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\">Pro Tips for Making PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\">How to Serve this PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Decadent layers of creamy peanut butter and fluffy marshmallow.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to make, perfect for any occasion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Kid-friendly and a hit with adults t