ccent-color)\" stroke-width=\"2.14929\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M1.73071 2.24432H16.3691\" stroke=\"var(--meadow-accent-color)\" stroke-width=\"2.14929\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M1.73071 13.6622H7.77047\" stroke=\"var(--meadow-accent-color)\" stroke-width=\"2.14929\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n</svg>\n</span> Notes</a></div>\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-40 wprm-column-rows-recipe-900 meadow-main-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-50 meadow-main-left\">\n      <div id=\"recipe-4501-ingredients\" class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredients-container wprm-recipe-4501-ingredients-container wprm-block-text-normal wprm-ingredient-style-regular wprm-recipe-images-before\" data-recipe=\"4501\" data-servings=\"12\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-ingredients-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-spacer wprm-header-has-actions wprm-header-has-actions\" style=\"\">Ingredients<div class=\"wprm-decoration-spacer\"></div>&nbsp;&nbsp;</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-internal-container wprm-internal-container-ingredients wprm-expandable-container wprm-expandable-expanded\" style=\"\"><div class=\"wprm-internal-container-toggle\"><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-show\" aria-label=\"Show Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,9.5 8,5 12.5,9.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-hide\" aria-label=\"Hide Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,6.5 8,11 12.5,6.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-group\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-ingredient-group-name wprm-block-text-bold\" style=\"color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">Chocolate Ingredients</div><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 5px;\"></div><ul class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredients\"><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">12</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">oz</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">semisweet chocolate chips</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">for a rich chocolatey flavor</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">2</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">tbsp</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">vegetable oil</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">to smooth out the chocolate</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-group\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-ingredient-group-name wprm-block-text-bold\" style=\"color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">Peanut Butter Filling Ingredients</div><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 5px;\"></div><ul class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredients\"><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cup</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">creamy peanut butter</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">for that classic peanut buttery taste</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cup</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">marshmallow fluff</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">adding a touch of sweetness and fluffiness</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">1/4</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit\">cup</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">powdered sugar</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">to sweeten the filling</span></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-uid=\"-1\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount\">pinch</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-name\">salt</span>&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded\">enhances the flavors</span></li></ul></div></div></div>\n      <div id=\"recipe-4501-equipment\" class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-container wprm-block-text-normal\" data-recipe=\"4501\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-equipment-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none\" style=\"\">Equipment</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-internal-container wprm-internal-container-equipment wprm-expandable-container wprm-expandable-expanded\" style=\"\"><div class=\"wprm-internal-container-toggle\"><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-show\" aria-label=\"Show Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,9.5 8,5 12.5,9.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a><a role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"wprm-expandable-button wprm-expandable-button-hide\" aria-label=\"Hide Section\"><span class=\"wprm-recipe-icon wprm-collapsible-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><g class=\"nc-icon-wrapper\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"3.5,6.5 8,11 12.5,6.5 \"></polyline></g></svg></span> </a></div><ul class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment wprm-recipe-equipment-list\"><li class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-name\">1 Muffin Tin&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-notes wprm-recipe-equipment-notes-normal\">For holding the cups</span></div></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--meadow-list-border-color);padding-bottom: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-name\">1 Microwave-safe Bowl&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-notes wprm-recipe-equipment-notes-normal\">For melting chocolate</span></div></li><li class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-item\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-name\">1 Spatula&#32;<span class=\"wprm-recipe-equipment-notes wprm-recipe-equipment-notes-normal\">For smoothing the filling</span></div></li></ul></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-50 meadow-main-right\">\n      <div id=\"recipe-4501-instructions\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-4501-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal\" data-recipe=\"4501\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-spacer wprm-header-has-actions\" style=\"\">Method<div class=\"wprm-decoration-spacer\"></div>&nbsp;</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-group\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-instruction-group-name wprm-block-text-bold\" style=\"color: #000000;\">Preparation Steps</div><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 5px;\"></div><ol class=\"wprm-recipe-instructions\"><li id=\"wprm-recipe-4501-step-0-0\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Start by lining a muffin tin with paper liners. This will hold your delicious cups and make for easy removal later.</div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-4501-step-0-1\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">In a microwave-safe bowl, combine chocolate chips and a splash of oil. Microwave in 30-second intervals, stirring in between, until the mixture is smooth and melted.</div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-4501-step-0-2\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Spoon 1 tablespoon of the melted chocolate into each paper liner. Tap the muffin tin gently to level the chocolate. Pop it in the freezer for 10 minutes to set.</div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-4501-step-0-3\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">In another bowl, mix together peanut butter, marshmallow fluff, powdered sugar, and a pinch of salt. Stir until the mixture is smooth and creamy.</div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-4501-step-0-4\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Drop a heaping teaspoon of the peanut butter mixture into each chocolate shell. Smooth the top with a spatula or the back of a spoon.</div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-4501-step-0-5\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Spoon the remaining melted chocolate over the peanut butter filling to seal it in. Make sure it’s well covered!</div></li><li id=\"wprm-recipe-4501-step-0-6\" class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe-instruction-text\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Return the muffin tin to the freezer for 20 to 30 minutes until set. Once firm, remove the cups from the liners and enjoy your homemade PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS!</div></li></ol></div></div>\n      \n      \n      <div id=\"recipe-4501-notes\" class=\"wprm-recipe-notes-container wprm-block-text-normal\"><h3 class=\"wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-notes-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none\" style=\"\">Notes</h3><div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div><div class=\"wprm-recipe-notes\"><table>\n<tr>\n<th>Nutrient</th>\n<th>Amount per Serving</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Calories</td>\n<td>200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fat</td>\n<td>12g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Protein</td>\n<td>4g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carbohydrates</td>\n<td>20g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sugar</td>\n<td>15g</td>\n</tr>\n</table></div></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 40px;\"></div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"ingredients-for-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\"><strong>Ingredients for PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Get ready to whip up some deliciousness with these easy-to-find ingredients for your PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Ingredients-for-Delicious-PEANUT-BUTTER-MARSHMALLOW-CUPS.webp\" alt=\"Ingredients for PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS displayed on a kitchen table.\" class=\"wp-image-4499\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Ingredients-for-Delicious-PEANUT-BUTTER-MARSHMALLOW-CUPS.webp 400w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Ingredients-for-Delicious-PEANUT-BUTTER-MARSHMALLOW-CUPS-225x300.webp 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>12 oz semisweet chocolate chips</strong> – for a rich chocolatey flavor</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>2 tbsp vegetable oil</strong> – to smooth out the chocolate</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>1 cup creamy <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peanut_butter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">peanut butter</a></strong> – for that classic peanut buttery taste</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>1 cup <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marshmallow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">marshmallow </a>fluff</strong> – adding a touch of sweetness and fluffiness</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>1/4 cup powdered sugar</strong> – to sweeten the filling</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>pinch of salt</strong> – enhances the flavors</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"how-to-make-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\"><strong>How to Make PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Get ready to indulge in a delightful treat! These PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS are a perfect blend of creamy peanut butter and fluffy marshmallow, all wrapped in a chocolatey shell. With a preparation time of 15 minutes, a cooking time of 10 minutes, and a chilling time of about 30 minutes, you’ll be enjoying these sweet bites in no time!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/How-to-Make-PEANUT-BUTTER-MARSHMALLOW-CUPS.webp\" alt=\"Step-by-step process of making PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS, including lined muffin tin, melted chocolate, peanut butter filling, and finished cups.\" class=\"wp-image-4500\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/How-to-Make-PEANUT-BUTTER-MARSHMALLOW-CUPS.webp 400w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/How-to-Make-PEANUT-BUTTER-MARSHMALLOW-CUPS-225x300.webp 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 1: Line the Muffin Tin</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Start by lining a muffin tin with paper liners. This will hold your delicious cups and make for easy removal later.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 2: Melt the Chocolate</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a microwave-safe bowl, combine chocolate chips and a splash of oil. Microwave in 30-second intervals, stirring in between, until the mixture is smooth and melted.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 3: Create the Chocolate Shell</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Spoon 1 tablespoon of the melted chocolate into each paper liner. Tap the muffin tin gently to level the chocolate. Pop it in the freezer for 10 minutes to set.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 4: Make the Peanut Butter Filling</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In another bowl, mix together peanut butter, marshmallow fluff, powdered sugar, and a pinch of salt. Stir until the mixture is smooth and creamy.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 5: Fill the Chocolate Shells</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Drop a heaping teaspoon of the peanut butter mixture into each chocolate shell. Smooth the top with a spatula or the back of a spoon.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 6: Seal with Chocolate</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Spoon the remaining melted chocolate over the peanut butter filling to seal it in. Make sure it’s well covered!</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 7: Chill and Serve</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Return the muffin tin to the freezer for 20 to 30 minutes until set. Once firm, remove the cups from the liners and enjoy your homemade PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS!</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"recipe-snapshot\"><strong>Recipe Snapshot</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Category</td><td>Dessert</td></tr><tr><td>Cuisine</td><td>American</td></tr><tr><td>Prep Time</td><td>15 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Cook Time</td><td>10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Extra Time</td><td>30 minutes (chilling)</td></tr><tr><td>Total Time</td><td>55 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Dietary</td><td>Vegetarian</td></tr><tr><td>Serves</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Best Served</td><td>Chilled and ready to enjoy!</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"pro-tips-for-making-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\"><strong>Pro Tips for Making PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Opt for creamy peanut butter for a smoother texture.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Chill the cups in the fridge for a firmer bite.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use mini marshmallows for a fun, chewy surprise.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Experiment with dark chocolate for a richer flavor.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Let the cups sit at room temperature for a few minutes before serving for the best taste.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"how-to-serve-this-peanut-butter-marshmallow-cups\"><strong>How to Serve this PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Serve chilled for a refreshing treat.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pair with a glass of almond milk for a nutty twist.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Top with crushed nuts for added crunch.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Drizzle with dark chocolate for extra indulgence.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Enjoy alongside fresh fruit for a balanced snack.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use as a filling in sandwiches for a fun twist.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"make-ahead-and-storage\"><strong>Make Ahead and Storage</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Keep your PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS fresh and delicious with these storage tips:</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Storing PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS Leftovers</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Allow cups to cool completely before storing.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Place in an airtight container.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Store in the refrigerator for up to one week.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Freezing PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Wrap each cup individually in plastic wrap.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Place wrapped cups in a freezer-safe bag or container.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Freeze for up to three months for best quality.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Reheating PEANUT BUTTER MARSHMALLOW CUPS</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Thaw cups in the refrigerator overnight before reheating.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Microwave for 10-15 seconds for a warm treat.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Check frequently to avoid overheating.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Explore more easy <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/breakfast/\"><strong>breakfast</strong></a> recipes, quick <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/lunch/\"><strong>lunch</strong></a> ideas, cozy <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/dinner/\"><strong>dinner</strong></a> meals, tasty <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/snacks/\"><strong>snacks</strong></a>, and delightful <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/category/dessert/\"><strong>dessert</strong></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"fa-qs\"><strong>FAQs</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here’s a helpful FAQ about this recipe:</p>\n\n\n<div id=\"rank-math-faq\" class=\"rank-math-block\">\n<div class=\"rank-math-list \">\n<div id=\"faq-question-1\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>1. What are peanut butter marshmallow squares called?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>Peanut butter marshmallow squares are often referred to as peanut butter marshmallow treats or simply marshmallow bars. They combine the creamy goodness of peanut butter with the fluffy texture of marshmallows, making for a delightful snack or dessert that many enjoy!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-2\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>2. What happened to Kirkland peanut butter cups?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>Kirkland peanut butter cups have been a popular item, but there have been reports of them being temporarily unavailable due to supply chain issues. However, they often return to shelves, so keep an eye out for them at your local Costco!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-3\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>3. What is a peanut butter and marshmallow sandwich called?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>A peanut butter and marshmallow sandwich is commonly known as a fluffernutter. This delicious combination of peanut butter and marshmallow fluff spread between two slices of bread is a nostalgic treat for many!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"faq-question-4\" class=\"rank-math-list-item\">\n<h3 class=\"rank-math-question \"><strong>4. Are peanut butter cups healthy for you?</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"rank-math-answer \">\n\n<p>Peanut butter cups can be a tasty treat, but they are typically high in sugar and calories, which may not make them the healthiest option. However, if you enjoy them in moderation and choose versions made with natural ingredients, they can fit into a balanced diet!</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"final-thoughts\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Get ready to indulge in the delightful world of Peanut Butter Marshmallow Cups! This simple recipe is a nostalgic treat that brings joy with every bite. Whether you&#8217;re sharing with friends or enjoying a quiet moment to yourself, these cups are sure to satisfy your sweet tooth. So grab your ingredients and let the fun begin!</p>\n",
